<article class="env-lemma" id="05NH">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/05NH">Lemma <span data-tag="05NH">17.17.6</span>.</a> Let $(X, \mathcal{O}_ X)$ be a ringed space. Let $U \subset X$ be open. The sheaf $j_{U!}\mathcal{O}_ U$ is a flat sheaf of $\mathcal{O}_ X$-modules. </p>
</article><article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      The stalks of $j_{U!}\mathcal{O}_ U$ are either zero or equal to $\mathcal{O}_{X, x}$. Apply Lemma <a href="/tag/05NE" data-tag="05NE">17.17.2</a>. 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
</article>